            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Whizbang 3.0.0, build 16

File reads, uploads and deletion now use Whizbang's authenticated Cloudflare storage gateway, including browser-media sync. This build is required for the full R2 storage cutover. Organization and owner permissions remain enforced by the existing storage authorization rules.

This release also includes the previously merged communications, job-processing and retired-engine cleanup changes. The API is prepared to run on the Linux host while Mac-only browser monitoring remains on the Mac Studio.
]]></description>
